## The brief
Sell My Caravan Right buys caravans and motorhomes directly from owners across South Wales. They needed a website that made it easy for sellers to request a free valuation online, without any of the hassle of listing, advertising, or negotiating a private sale themselves.

## What we built
A clear, trust-building website built around a simple valuation form. Sellers submit details of their caravan or motorhome, the team gets in touch with an offer, and — if accepted — collect and pay for the vehicle directly. Built to rank locally and convert visitors into valuation enquiries.

## Results
- A live valuation funnel generating enquiries from day one
- A straightforward path from enquiry to collection and payment
- A professional platform that builds trust with sellers handing over a high-value vehicle

NC Digital builds lead-generating websites for businesses in [Merthyr Tydfil](/web-design-merthyr-tydfil/) and across South Wales.
